{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06527","headline":"题眄上人禅居 · 储光羲","name":"题眄上人禅居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真王清净子，燕居复行心。\n结宇邻居邑，寤言非远寻。\n丹青丈室满，草树一庭深。\n秀色玄冬发，交枝白日阴。\n江流暎朱户，山鸟鸣香林。\n独住已寂寂，安知浮与沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}